// 页不扫描对方的今日位置、不因全局存在邀约就显示内容；只展示本人实际来源或现场原接待者递来的回帖。
#include "visit_appointment_view.hpp"
#include "visit_appointment_meeting_time2.hpp"
#include "visit_appointment_detail.hpp"
namespace hanmo::resident {namespace {
using V=BoundaryValue;
V identity(const WorldIdentity& s){StableId id;constexpr char digits[]="0123456789abcdef";for(auto b:s.world_id){id+=digits[b>>4];id+=digits[b&15];}return boundary::obj({{"world_id",V{id}},{"execution_epoch",V{s.execution_epoch}},{"revision",V{s.revision}},{"tick",V{s.tick}}});}
BoundaryValue action(const StableId& label,const StableId& kind,const BoundaryValue& params){return boundary::obj({{"text",V{label}},{"command",V{kind}},{"params",params},{"available",V{true}},{"code",V{StableId{}}}});}
StableId terms_text(const VisitAppointmentTerms& t){return "原约地点："+t.place_id+"；接受须早于半日 "+std::to_string(t.accept_before_tick)+"，实际赴约窗口为半日 "+std::to_string(t.earliest_tick)+" 至 "+std::to_string(t.latest_tick)+"，会面用时一个半日。领回不等于接受，约期不会随领回日期重算。";}
BoundaryValue original_action(const StableId& label,const VisitAppointmentCommand& command){return action(label,visit_appointment_command_kind(command),encode_visit_appointment_command(command));}
StableId text(const StableId& status){if(status=="promised")return "我已承诺原约期；尚不能远方知道对方是否领回或答允";if(status=="collected")return "已亲自领回，尚未接受";if(status=="accepted")return "我已明确接受原约期";if(status=="acceptance_expired")return "已过接受期限，原日期不会重算";if(status=="window_elapsed")return "原约期已经过去";if(status=="meeting")return "双方正在实际会面";if(status=="cancelled")return "双方已当面取消";if(status=="fulfilled")return "双方已完成此次会面";return "原会面行动已中止";}
}
Outcome<BoundaryValue> query_visit_appointments(const CommonStore& c,const VisitMessageState& messages,const VisitMessageCatalog& originals,const PersonalAppointmentCatalog& appointments,const PersonalAppointmentState& personal,const InteractionState& interaction,const InteractionCatalog& definitions,const InteractionAccess& access,const VisitAppointmentCatalog& catalog,const VisitAppointmentState& invitations,const VisitAppointmentMeetingState& meetings,Integer cursor,Integer offer_cursor,const VisitReplyCatalog* ordinary,const VisitAppointmentMeetingTime2Context* exact){
 if(cursor<0||cursor>1000000||offer_cursor<0||offer_cursor>1000000)return {false,{},common_failure("InvalidVisitAppointmentCursor").error};const auto& actor=c.state().metadata.player_actor_id;if(!c.actor(actor))return {false,{},common_failure("UnknownVisitAppointmentObserver",actor).error};if(invitations.version==2&&!exact)return {false,{},common_failure("VisitAppointmentTime2ReadRequired",{},ErrorKind::unsupported_capability).error};if(exact&&(&exact->common!=&c||&exact->invitations!=&invitations||&exact->state!=&meetings))return {false,{},common_failure("VisitAppointmentViewCandidateMismatch",{},ErrorKind::internal).error};VisitAppointmentAccess known(c,invitations,&meetings,exact?&exact->clock:nullptr);V::Array rows,offers;std::vector<BoundaryValue> candidates,offer_candidates;
 for(const auto& row:invitations.offered.rows()){auto read=known.known_visit_appointment(actor,row.first);if(!read.ok)return {false,{},read.error};V::Array commands;if(!read.value){VisitAppointmentCommand request=CollectVisitAppointment{row.first};auto q=preview_visit_appointment(c,messages,originals,appointments,personal,interaction,definitions,access,catalog,invitations,actor,request,ordinary,&meetings,exact?&exact->invitation_life:nullptr);if(!q.ok){if(q.error.kind!=ErrorKind::rule)return {false,{},q.error};continue;}commands.push_back(original_action("亲自领回邀约",request));candidates.push_back(boundary::obj({{"id",V{row.first}},{"display_name",V{StableId{"原接待者保管的邀约"}}},{"invitation_fact_id",V{row.first}},{"known",V{false}},{"status",V{StableId{"waiting_at_custodian"}}},{"status_text",V{StableId{"当面可领取"}}},{"progress_text",V{StableId{"原接待者有一份给你的邀约回帖，领回后才可查看条款；领取不会替你答允。"}}},{"actions",V{std::move(commands)}}}));continue;}
  const auto& r=*read.value;const auto& t=r.terms;const bool invitee=r.perspective==VisitAppointmentPerspective::invitee;if(invitee&&r.acceptance_fact_id.empty()){VisitAppointmentCommand request=AcceptVisitAppointment{row.first,r.collection_fact_id};auto q=preview_visit_appointment(c,messages,originals,appointments,personal,interaction,definitions,access,catalog,invitations,actor,request,ordinary,&meetings,exact?&exact->invitation_life:nullptr);if(q.ok)commands.push_back(original_action("明确接受这份原约期",request));else if(q.error.kind!=ErrorKind::rule)return {false,{},q.error};}
  if(invitee&&!r.acceptance_fact_id.empty()){auto q=preview_visit_appointment_meeting(c,interaction,definitions,access,appointments,invitations,meetings,actor,{row.first,r.acceptance_fact_id},exact);if(q.ok)commands.push_back(action("双方实际会面一个半日",visit_appointment_meeting_action_kind,boundary::obj({{"invitation_fact_id",V{row.first}},{"acceptance_fact_id",V{r.acceptance_fact_id}}})));else if(q.error.kind!=ErrorKind::rule)return {false,{},q.error};auto cancel=preview_visit_appointment_meeting_cancel(c,interaction,definitions,access,appointments,invitations,meetings,actor,{row.first,r.acceptance_fact_id},exact);if(cancel.ok)commands.push_back(action("双方当面取消", "cancel_visit_appointment",boundary::obj({{"invitation_fact_id",V{row.first}},{"acceptance_fact_id",V{r.acceptance_fact_id}}})));else if(cancel.error.kind!=ErrorKind::rule)return {false,{},cancel.error};}
  auto item=boundary::obj({{"id",V{row.first}},{"display_name",V{StableId{"本人的原约期"}}},{"invitation_fact_id",V{row.first}},{"known",V{true}},{"perspective",V{StableId{invitee?"invitee":"inviter"}}},{"status",V{r.known_status}},{"status_text",V{text(r.known_status)}},{"terms_text",V{terms_text(t)}},{"other_actor_id",V{invitee?t.inviter_actor_id:t.invitee_actor_id}},{"place_id",V{t.place_id}},{"offered_tick",V{t.offered_tick}},{"accept_before_tick",V{t.accept_before_tick}},{"earliest_tick",V{t.earliest_tick}},{"latest_tick",V{t.latest_tick}},{"duration_ticks",V{t.duration_ticks}},{"learned_tick",V{r.learned_tick}},{"actions",V{std::move(commands)}}});if(invitee){item.as<V::Dict>()->emplace_back("collection_fact_id",V{r.collection_fact_id});item.as<V::Dict>()->emplace_back("acceptance_fact_id",V{r.acceptance_fact_id});}if(!r.meeting_fact_id.empty())item.as<V::Dict>()->emplace_back("meeting_fact_id",V{r.meeting_fact_id});candidates.push_back(std::move(item));
 }
 for(const auto& row:messages.received.rows()){if(row.second.contact.actor_id!=actor)continue;const auto* message=messages.posted.find(row.second.message_fact_id);if(!message) return {false,{},common_failure("VisitAppointmentOriginalDeliveryRequired",row.first).error};for(const auto& p:catalog.policies)if(p.message_policy_id==message->policy_id){VisitAppointmentCommand command=OfferVisitAppointment{p.id,message->fact_id};auto q=preview_visit_appointment(c,messages,originals,appointments,personal,interaction,definitions,access,catalog,invitations,actor,command,ordinary,&meetings,exact?&exact->invitation_life:nullptr);if(q.ok){const auto& t=q.value.terms;offer_candidates.push_back(boundary::obj({{"id",V{message->fact_id}},{"display_name",V{StableId{"答复已领读的拜帖"}}},{"message_fact_id",V{message->fact_id}},{"status_text",V{StableId{"本人尚未发出此邀约"}}},{"progress_text",V{StableId{"托回这份邀请即承诺自己的固定约期；对方仍须亲自领回后再接受。"}}},{"terms_text",V{terms_text(t)}},{"place_id",V{t.place_id}},{"accept_before_tick",V{t.accept_before_tick}},{"earliest_tick",V{t.earliest_tick}},{"latest_tick",V{t.latest_tick}},{"actions",V{V::Array{original_action("承诺原约期并托回邀请",command)}}}}));}else if(q.error.kind!=ErrorKind::rule)return {false,{},q.error};}}
 const auto offset=static_cast<std::size_t>(cursor),offer_offset=static_cast<std::size_t>(offer_cursor);if(offset>candidates.size()||offer_offset>offer_candidates.size())return {false,{},common_failure("InvalidVisitAppointmentCursor").error};constexpr std::size_t page=16;
 for(std::size_t i=offset;i<candidates.size()&&i<offset+page;++i)rows.push_back(std::move(candidates[i]));
 for(std::size_t i=offer_offset;i<offer_candidates.size()&&i<offer_offset+page;++i)offers.push_back(std::move(offer_candidates[i]));
 V::Dict out{{"ok",V{true}},{"enabled",V{true}},{"source_identity",identity(c.state().identity)},{"observer_actor_id",V{actor}},{"cursor",V{cursor}},{"offer_cursor",V{offer_cursor}},{"rows",V{std::move(rows)}},{"offers",V{std::move(offers)}}};
 if(offset+page<candidates.size())out.emplace_back("next_cursor",V{static_cast<Integer>(offset+page)});
 if(offer_offset+page<offer_candidates.size())out.emplace_back("next_offer_cursor",V{static_cast<Integer>(offer_offset+page)});
 return {true,V{std::move(out)},{}};
}
}
